### Upload documento RAG
POST {{base_url}}/api/admin/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="nome"

Tabela de honorários trabalhistas
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="honorarios.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/honorarios.pdf
--boundary--

> {%
    client.global.set("document_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Listar documentos RAG
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/documents?page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Associar documento a especialista
POST {{base_url}}/api/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document_id": "{{document_id}}"
}

### Listar documentos de um especialista
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Desassociar documento
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/documents/{{document_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Criar MCP server
POST {{base_url}}/api/admin/mcps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Consulta processual",
  "url": "http://mcp-consulta:3000",
  "config": {}
}

> {%
    client.global.set("mcp_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Associar MCP a especialista
POST {{base_url}}/api/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/mcps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mcp_id": "{{mcp_id}}"
}

###

### Criar guardrail
POST {{base_url}}/api/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/guardrails
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo": "topico_proibido",
  "regra": "Nunca dar conselho médico",
  "mensagem": "Desculpe, não posso ajudar com questões médicas. Posso ajudar com questões jurídicas."
}

### Listar guardrails do especialista
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/guardrails
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Criar step do script de atendimento
POST {{base_url}}/api/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/steps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ordem": 1,
  "texto": "Qual é o seu nome completo?",
  "tipo_dado_esperado": "texto",
  "obrigatorio": true,
  "pontuacao": 2
}

### Listar steps do especialista
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/steps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reordenar steps
PUT {{base_url}}/api/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/steps/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order": ["step_id_1", "step_id_2", "step_id_3"]
}

###

### Configurar scoring
PUT {{base_url}}/api/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/scoring
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "total_pontos": 10,
  "threshold_qualificacao": 6
}

### Consultar scoring
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/scoring
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
